          "text": "ወእሤርዎን፡ ለአህጉረ፡ ብሔርከ፡ ወአንኅ፡ ኮሎ፡ አጽዋኒከ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 13,
          "unit_order": 13,
          "source_marker": "12",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Mic&chapter=5&verse=12"
          ],
          "text": "ወእስዕር፡ ኮሎ፡ ስራያቲከ፡ እምእደዊክ፡ ወአልቦ፡ ዘይትዋሳእ፡ ላከ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 14,
          "unit_order": 14,
          "source_marker": "13",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Mic&chapter=5&verse=13"
          ],
          "text": "ወእሤሩ፡ ግልፎከ፡ ወአምሳሊከ፡ እማእከልከ፡ ወኢትሰግድ፡ እንከ፡ ግብረ፡ እደዊከ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 15,
          "unit_order": 15,
          "source_marker": "14",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Mic&chapter=5&verse=14"
          ],
          "text": "ወእገዝም፡ ምህራማቲከ፡ እማእከልከ፡ ወአጠፍኦን፡ ለአህጉሪከ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 16,
          "unit_order": 16,
          "source_marker": "15",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Mic&chapter=5&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "ወእገብር፡ በቀለ፡ ውስተ፡ አህዛብ፡ በመዐትየ፡ ወበመቅሠፍትየ፡ እስመ፡ ኢሰምኡ።"
        }
